# Playwright and Storybook
# Only the Linux baselines are committed: they are the ones CI compares
# against. A local run writes its own platform's folder next to them.
packages/embed/e2e/__screenshots__/darwin/
packages/embed/e2e/__screenshots__/win32/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
test-results/
**/playwright/.cache/
storybook-static/
*storybook.log
